From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:40:01 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 081/105] clk: samsung: exynos7570: add CMU_G3D

Add the clocks of the Mali-T720: CLKCMU_G3D in CMU_MIF (mux of the
shared PLLs, divider, gate) and CMU_G3D with the G3D user mux, the
bus and APB dividers and the GPU core gate. The ids of CMU_MIF are
appended so the existing ones stay the same.

The other gates of CMU_G3D (async bridges, register slices, PMU,
sysreg, QE, PPMU, secure firewall) are not registered and stay as the
bootloader leaves them, which is on.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 07600c011f44771bf57eb3ef779b709260f660f7)
---
 .../clock/samsung,exynos7570-cmu.yaml         | 24 +++++++-
 drivers/clk/samsung/clk-exynos7570.c          | 58 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../clock/samsung,exynos7570-cmu.h            | 12 +++-
 3 files changed, 92 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

